---
import Base from '~/layouts/Base.astro';
import LegalFrame from '~/components/LegalFrame.astro';
const headings=[{slug:'scope',text:'1. Website and product terms'},{slug:'content',text:'2. Content and permitted use'},{slug:'links',text:'3. Availability and external services'},{slug:'contact',text:'4. Updates and contact'}];
---
<Base locale="en" path="/terms" title="Website Terms" description="Terms for browsing SATER news, product information and the website game.">
<LegalFrame title="Website Terms" current="terms" updated="14 October 2026" headings={headings}>
<h2 id="scope">1. Website and product terms</h2><p>This website presents SATER products, news and an optional browser game. Installing an app or making a store purchase is subject to that product’s Terms and the store’s conditions, rather than a purchase contract on this website.</p>
<h2 id="content">2. Content and permitted use</h2><p>You may browse and share links to public pages. Original SATER branding, text and artwork belong to SATER or their rights holders; third-party assets retain their licences. Do not misrepresent an affiliation, redistribute original assets without permission or interfere with the website. Browser-game scores have no monetary value and create no entitlement to a prize.</p>
<h2 id="links">3. Availability and external services</h2><p>News describes the version and date identified in each story; features and availability may subsequently change. External store listings control current download availability, prices and purchasing conditions. Links to other services do not guarantee their availability or endorse every item they display.</p><p>We work to keep information accurate but do not guarantee uninterrupted access or an error-free website. Any limitation applies only to the extent permitted by law; mandatory consumer rights remain unaffected.</p>
<h2 id="contact">4. Updates and contact</h2><p>We may update website information or these Terms and revise the date above. For corrections, permissions or support, contact <a href="mailto:sater.studios@gmail.com">sater.studios@gmail.com</a>.</p>
</LegalFrame></Base>
